[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11280.309, "timestamp": "03:08:00", "text": "我看了大部分。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11281.99, "timestamp": "03:08:01", "text": "“哇，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11289.67, "timestamp": "03:08:09", "text": "这就像是为她的观众准备的观众，或者"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11293.19, "timestamp": "03:08:13", "text": "她朋友的观众，他们就是她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11295.75, "timestamp": "03:08:15", "text": "谈论他们背后的那个人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11298.87, "timestamp": "03:08:18", "text": "回到风险投资电话会议之类的场合，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11301.11, "timestamp": "03:08:21", "text": "这三个人中有人喜欢，很多人都喜欢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11304.79, "timestamp": "03:08:24", "text": "诸如此类的事情。是的。太多了。 M"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11306.87, "timestamp": "03:08:26", "text": "有人泄露了这件事。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 11307.89, "timestamp": "03:08:27", "author": "@N_I_R_NASHAK", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/1tUEQ85FwbdYgcMSwBtAKUjwpzN8k-JYCUeDTQQXUvSFn0hVEvGSW0HPICJMtxNg5tVEcjZ-cOc=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "bruh the apology leter is also available now it's horrible"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11309.269, "timestamp": "03:08:29", "text": "对话内容被录音并泄露了出去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11313.51, "timestamp": "03:08:33", "text": "公开谈论某事。哦，还有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11316.79, "timestamp": "03:08:36", "text": "我当时就想，呃，那只鹦鹉是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11318.55, "timestamp": "03:08:38", "text": "为了有机会让自己保持活力"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11323.03, "timestamp": "03:08:43", "text": "这些剧集？是的。你看《鹦鹉》吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11325.03, "timestamp": "03:08:45", "text": "鹦鹉视频？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11326.79, "timestamp": "03:08:46", "text": "是的。他好像太优秀了，让人难以跟上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11329.83, "timestamp": "03:08:49", "text": "鉴于目前发生的种种戏剧性事件。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11332.07, "timestamp": "03:08:52", "text": "他对这些东西了如指掌，就像个行家一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11333.99, "timestamp": "03:08:53", "text": "玩